1048:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_rcc.c ****   *                frequency of the crystal used. Otherwise, this function may
1049:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_rcc.c ****   *                have wrong result.
